{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"958","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"上市櫃10月營收 創23個月新高","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">04:09 2020/11/11 工商時報 李娟萍</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\\\"><img alt=\\\"上市櫃10月合併營收表現\\\" src=\\\"https://images.chinatimes.com/newsphoto/2020-11-11/CLIPPING/1024/A01A00_T_02_02.jpg\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; width: 80%;\\\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">上市櫃10月合併營收表現</span></p>\r\n\r\n<hr style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-top: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\\\" />\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">延續旺季效應，上市櫃公司10月營收達3.24兆元，月增1.88％、年增0.76％，創下2018年12月，23個月以來單月新高，累計前十月營收28.22兆元，年減1.47％。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">新台幣兌美元匯率10月狂升2.01角，但不影響上市櫃營收衝高動能。台新投顧副總經理黃文清分析，上市櫃公司計有78家創新高，較9月143家減少，累計營收前五大企業分別是鴻海、台積電、和碩、廣達及仁寶，營收達8,276億～3.96兆元，均為產業代工大廠。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">就產業別區分，10月營收年增前三大族群分別為被動元件、IC設計及網通；月增前三大族群分別為汽車、運輸及金融。此外，金融股10月營收雖呈月成長，但年減15％，仍是上市櫃公司今年以來表現較差的類股；10月營收年減的類股，尚有IPC及零售業。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">凱基投顧董事長朱晏民指出，第四季因今年iPhone新機延後上市，且iPhone傳出新機加單，手機族群業績動能看俏，加上遠距辦公、遠距教學，筆電、桌機、伺服器等也持續追單，電子股業績仍有高峰可期，第四季營收有機會出現微幅季成長。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">第一金投顧董事長陳奕光則認為，受惠蘋果iPhone 12大賣、5G應用科技，還有遠距商機升溫，10月出口值達到322.3億美元、創下歷年單月新高。10月出口年增率高達11.2％雙位數成長、連四紅達陣。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">展望11月出口表現，財政部預測，11月出口應為正成長5～8％，可續創連五紅，主要是iPhone 12持續熱銷，台積電也在10月法說會上調全年營收年增三成、挑戰1.4兆元，短期內電子零組件出口動能將繼續維持。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">陳奕光預測，第四季營收高點在11月，12月營收受到定期盤點及長假影響，會出現下滑。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">國泰證期經理蔡明翰認為，疫情減緩對經濟造成的衝擊也逐漸淡化，台灣電子商品與機械設備出口持續增加，帶動台灣企業營收持續走高，今年上半年因疫情導致歐美消費停滯，預期有望移轉至今年底的消費旺季。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">因此，他預期第四季營收表現仍將維持亮眼表現，不過，近期美國第三波疫情再起，恐對消費旺季造成干擾，仍須觀察後續業績動能是否可以持續。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">資料來源: https://www.chinatimes.com/newspapers/20201111000131-260202?chdtv</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2020-11-13","clk_count":"66"}},"__N_SSG":true}